	avenue that connects companies and startups <strong>accounting for</strong> a
	third of the <strong>venture capital</strong> investment in the United States
	each year. “Growing up, I <strong>got inspired by</strong>
	the history of the place,” Jobs said. “That made me want to be a part of it.”
</p>
