	<strong>ham radio operator</strong>, <strong>hard-core</strong> electronics
	guy,” Jobs recalled. “He would bring me stuff to play with.” As we
	<strong>walked up to</strong> Lang’s old house, Jobs pointed to the driveway.
</p>
