<p>
	“No, it needs an amplifier,” his father assured him. When Steve
	<strong>protested otherwise</strong>, his father said he was crazy. “It can’t
	work without an amplifier. There’s some trick.” “I
	<strong>kept saying</strong> no to my dad, telling him he had to see it, and
