	Джобс.
</p>

<p>
	“Dylan taped all of his concerts, and some of the people around him were not
	<strong>scrupulous</strong>, because soon there were tapes all around.
	<strong>Bootlegs</strong> of everything. And this guy had them all.” Hunting
	down Dylan tapes soon became a <strong>joint venture</strong>.
</p>
