</p>

<p>
	<strong>Showing off</strong> the Homestead campus four decades later, Jobs paused at the scene
	of the <strong>escapade</strong> and pointed. “See that balcony? That’s where we did the banner
	prank that <strong>sealed our friendship</strong>.” On a big bedsheet Baum had
	<strong>tie-dyed</strong> with the school’s green and white colors, they
