<p><strong>. . . Drop Out</strong></p>
<p class="translation">. . . Бросить учёбу</p>

<p>
	Jobs quickly became bored with college. He liked being at Reed, just not
	taking the <strong>required classes</strong>. In fact he was surprised when he
	found out that, <strong>for all of its hippie aura</strong>, there were strict
