</p>

<p><strong>The Homebrew Computer Club</strong></p>
<p class="translation">Компьютерный клуб Homebrew.</p>

<p>
	The group became known as the Homebrew Computer Club, and it <strong>encapsulated</strong> the
	<strong>Whole Earth</strong> fusion between the counterculture and technology.
	It would become to the personal computer era something
	<strong>akin to</strong> what the Turk’s Head coffeehouse was to the age of
	Dr. Johnson, a place where ideas were exchanged and <strong>disseminated</strong>.
</p>
