</p>

<p>
	“Why don’t we build and sell <strong>printed circuit boards</strong> to them?” It was an
	example of their <strong>symbiosis</strong>. “Every time I’d design something
	great, Steve would find a way to make money for us,” said Wozniak. Wozniak
	admitted that he would have never thought of doing that <strong>on his own</strong>.
</p>
