</p>

<p>
	They considered some typical tech words, such as Matrix, and some <strong>neologisms</strong>,
	such as Executek, and some <strong>straightforward</strong> boring names, like Personal
	Computers Inc. The deadline for deciding was the next day, when Jobs wanted to
