</p>

<p>
	And the two words together—Apple Computer—provided an amusing
	<strong>disjuncture</strong>. “It doesn’t quite make sense,” said Mike
	Markkula, who soon <strong>thereafter</strong> became the first chairman of the new company.
	“So it forces your brain to <strong>dwell on</strong> it. Apple and computers, that doesn’t go
