</p>

<p>
	Wozniak was not yet ready to <strong>commit full-time</strong>. He was an HP <strong>company man</strong> <strong>at
	heart</strong>, or so he thought, and he wanted to keep his day job there. Jobs
	realized he needed an ally to help <strong>corral</strong> Wozniak and
	<strong>adjudicate</strong> if there was a disagreement.
</p>
