	принадлежать партнёрству Apple.
</p>

<p>
	“Woz had a <strong>parental attitude toward</strong> the circuits he developed, and he wanted
	to be able to use them in other <strong>applications</strong> or let HP use them,” Wayne said.
	“Jobs and I realized that these circuits would be the <strong>core</strong> of Apple. We spent
	two hours in a <strong>roundtable discussion</strong> at my apartment, and I
	was able to get Woz to accept this.”
</p>
<table class="explanation">
	<tr>
		<td><strong>parental attitude toward</strong></td>
		<td>отношение как к собственному ребёнку, сильная опека</td>
