	телевизор, чтобы посмотреть конец футбольного матча.
</p>

<p>
	During some of these <strong>breaks</strong>, Jobs and Kottke would go outside and play guitar
	on the lawn. Clara Jobs didn’t mind losing most of her house to piles of parts
