	диеты сына.
</p>

<p>
	“She would <strong>roll her eyes</strong> at his latest <strong>eating obsessions</strong>,” recalled Holmes.
	“She just wanted him to be healthy, and he would be making weird
	<strong>pronouncements</strong> like, ‘I’m a fruitarian and I will only eat
	leaves picked by virgins in the moonlight.’”
</p>
