</p>

<p>
	In order to make Apple seem like a real company, Jobs hired an <strong>answering
	service</strong>, which would <strong>relay messages</strong> to his mother. Ron Wayne drew a logo,
	using the <strong>ornate</strong> <strong>line-drawing</strong> style of Victorian illustrated fiction, that
	featured Newton sitting under a tree <strong>framed by</strong> a quote from Wordsworth: “A
