</p>

<p>
	The relationship between Jobs and Brennan quickly
	<strong>deteriorated</strong>. “Chrisann would get into this kind of
	<strong>victim mode</strong>, when she would say that Steve and I were
	<strong>ganging up on</strong> her,” Kottke recalled. “Steve would just laugh
