<section id="sec29">
<h1>CHAPTER TWENTY-EIGHT</h1>
<h2><strong>CEO</strong></h2>
<h2>Still Crazy after All These Years</h2>

<figure>
	<img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Tim Cook and Jobs, 2007" />
