</figure>

<p><strong>Tim Cook</strong></p>
<p class="translation">Тим Кук</p>

<p>
	When Steve Jobs returned to Apple and produced the “Think Different” ads and
	the iMac in his first year, it confirmed what most people already knew: that
	he could be creative and <strong>a visionary</strong>. He had shown that during <strong>his first round
	at Apple</strong>. What was less clear was whether he could run a company. He had
	definitely <strong>not</strong> shown that during his first round.
</p>
<table class="explanation">
