</p>

<p>
	As the stores <strong>flourished</strong>, Jobs stayed involved in every aspect. Lee Clow
	recalled, “In one of our marketing meetings just as the stores were opening,
	Steve made us spend a half hour deciding <strong>what hue of gray</strong> the restroom signs
