	проект не начнём, пока ты не подпишешься на полный день. Ты в деле или нет?
	Решай прямо сейчас».
</p>

<p>
	Fadell looked Rubinstein in the eye, then turned to the audience and said,
	“Does this always happen at Apple, that people are put
	<strong>under duress</strong> to sign an offer?” He paused for a moment, said
	yes, and <strong>grudgingly</strong> shook Rubinstein’s hand. “It left some
	very <strong>unsettling feeling</strong> between Jon and me for many years,”
	Fadell recalled. Rubinstein agreed: “I don’t think he ever forgave me for
	that.”
</p>
