	thousand songs. “We suddenly were looking at one another and saying, ‘This is
	going to be so cool,’” Jobs recalled. “We knew how cool it was, because we
	knew how badly we each wanted one personally. And the concept became so
	beautifully simple: a thousand songs in your pocket.” One of the
