	pulling off <strong>a velvet cloth</strong>. Instead he said, “I happen to
	have one right here in my pocket.” He reached into his jeans and pulled out
	the <strong>gleaming</strong> white device. “This amazing little device holds
	a thousand songs, and it goes right in my pocket.” He slipped it back in and
	<strong>ambled offstage</strong> to applause.
