	квартал. Я заставлял себя доходить до садов в нескольких кварталах, потом
	дальше, и за шесть месяцев силы почти вернулись».
</p>

<p>
	Unfortunately the cancer had spread. During the operation the doctors found
	three <strong>liver metastases</strong>. Had they operated nine months earlier, they might have
	caught it before it spread, though they would never know for sure. Jobs began
	<strong>chemotherapy</strong> treatments, which further complicated his eating challenges.
