	разъединённый подход Microsoft успешнее на рынке персональных компьютеров. И
	вскользь задал вопрос: какой подход лучше сработает на мобильных телефонах?
</p>

<p>
	Then he went on to make an insightful point: This difference in design
	philosophy, he said, led him and Apple to be less good at collaborating with
	other companies. “Because Woz and I started the company based on <strong>doing the
	whole banana</strong>, we weren’t so good at <strong>partnering with people</strong>,” he said. “And I
	think if Apple could have had a little more of that in its DNA, it would have
	served it extremely well.”
</p>
