	famous <strong>quip</strong> a few days later at his annual music event. “Reports of my death
	are greatly exaggerated,” he said, as he launched a line of new iPods. But <strong>his
	gaunt appearance</strong> was not reassuring. By early October the stock price had sunk
	to $97.
</p>
