	annoyed that Apple wasn’t being more active in pushing back. So on January 5,
	2009, he wrote and released a misleading open letter. He claimed that he was
	skipping Macworld because he wanted to spend more time with his family. “As
	many of you know, I have been losing weight throughout 2008,” he added. “My
	doctors think they have found the cause—<strong>a hormone imbalance</strong> that has been
	robbing me of the proteins my body needs to be healthy. Sophisticated blood
	tests have confirmed this diagnosis. <strong>The remedy</strong> for this nutritional problem
