	приземлились незадолго до четырёх утра, где их встретил Изон. На лётном поле
	ждала машина, всё было устроено так, чтобы бумаги приёма оформили на ходу,
	пока они мчались в больницу.
</p>

<p>
	The transplant was a success, but not reassuring. When the doctors took out
	his liver, they found spots on <strong>the peritoneum</strong>, the thin membrane that
	surrounds internal organs. In addition, there were tumors throughout the
	liver, which meant it was likely that the cancer had <strong>migrated elsewhere</strong> as
	well. It had apparently <strong>mutated</strong> and grown quickly. They took samples and did
	more <strong>genetic mapping</strong>.
</p>
