	восстановить.
</p>

<p>
	As Jobs got better, much of <strong>his feisty personality</strong> returned. He still had <strong>his
	bile ducts</strong>. “When he started to recover, he passed quickly through the phase
	of gratitude, and went right back into the mode of being <strong>grumpy and in
	charge</strong>,” Kat Smith recalled. “We were all wondering if he was going to come
	out of this with a kinder perspective, but he didn’t.”
</p>
