	this question since the original Macintosh. “Apple has taken its <strong>control-freak
	rep</strong> to a whole new level with the A4 chip that powers the thing,” wrote Fortt.
	“Cupertino now has <strong>absolute say</strong> over the silicon, device, operating system,
