	Murdoch was reported to have <strong>uttered a great line</strong> about the <strong>organic vegan
	dishes</strong> typically served: “Eating dinner at Steve’s is a great experience, as
	long as you <strong>get out before the local restaurants close</strong>.” Alas, when I asked
	Murdoch if he had ever said that, he <strong>didn’t recall</strong> it.
