	discuss how to <strong>draw lines</strong> without looking like a <strong>censor</strong>. He asked Friedman to
	<strong>head an advisory group</strong> to help <strong>come up with guidelines</strong>, but the columnist’s
	publisher said it would be a <strong>conflict of interest</strong>, and no such committee was
	formed.
