<p><strong>Antennagate: Design versus Engineering</strong></p>
<p class="translation">Антеннагейт: дизайн против инженерии</p>

<p>
	In many consumer product companies, there’s <strong>tension</strong> between the designers, who
	want to make a product look beautiful, and the engineers, who need to make
	sure it <strong>fulfills its functional requirements</strong>. At Apple, where Jobs pushed both
	design and engineering to the edge, that <strong>tension</strong> was even greater.
</p>

