	sometimes the cruise worked well. “The best vacation I’ve ever been on was
	when we went down the coast of Italy, then to Athens—which is <strong>a pit</strong>, but the
	Parthenon is <strong>mind-blowing</strong>—and then to Ephesus in Turkey, where they have
