	friend, is no longer writing good things about us.” In front of the whole
	audience, he <strong>got rid of</strong> the leader of the MobileMe team and replaced him
	with Eddy Cue, who <strong>oversaw</strong> all Internet content at Apple. As
	<strong>Fortune</strong>’s Adam Lashinsky reported in a <strong>dissection</strong> of the
	Apple corporate culture, “<strong>Accountability is strictly enforced</strong>.”
</p>

